<div class="mv-wrap js-bg-section">
    <a href="#new" class="mv-inner">
        <%# 2つのレイアウトを6秒ごとにフェードで切り替える（_mv-loop.js）。表示中の方に is-active（ページを開いた直後にJSで付与） %>
        <div class="mv-content mv-content_1">
            <div class="mv-head">
                <h1 class="main-ttl en-bold">
                    <p><span>WARMTH </span><span class="with">TO</span></p>
                    <p><span class="second">EXPLORE.</span></p>
                </h1>
                <p class="main-subttl">冬を、この一着と探求する｡</p>
                <p class="main-season mv-season">2026 秋 / 冬</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mv-photo">
                <div class="mv-photo-main">
                    <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv_1.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="mv-photo-sub">
                    <div class="mv-photo-item mv-photo-item1">
                        <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv_2.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mv-photo-item mv-photo-item2">
                        <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv_3.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mv-photo-item mv-photo-item3">
                        <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv_4.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <%# テキストは mv-content_1 と同じ内容のため、読み上げは1回で済むよう aria-hidden %>
        <div class="mv-content mv-content_2" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mv-photo">
                <div class="mv-photo-sub">
                    <div class="mv-photo-item mv-photo-item1">
                        <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv2_2.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mv-photo-item mv-photo-item2">
                        <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv2_3.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                    <div class="mv-photo-item mv-photo-item3">
                        <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv2_4.jpg" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mv-photo-main">
                    <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/mv2_1.jpg" alt="">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mv-head">
                <h1 class="main-ttl en-bold">
                    <p><span>WARMTH </span><span class="with">TO</span></p>
                    <p><span class="second">EXPLORE.</span></p>
                </h1>
                <p class="main-subttl">冬を、この一着と探求する｡</p>
                <p class="main-season mv-season">2026 秋 / 冬</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mv-logo">
            <img src="<%= rootURL %>/assets/img/tnf_logo.png" alt="THE NORTH FACE">
        </div>
    </a>
</div>
